    try {
      const response = await fetch('https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: getApiHeaders(),
        body: JSON.stringify({
          model: 'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001',
          max_tokens: 1000,
          system: `You are a maternal nutrition AI assistant. The patient is Sarah Lee, Week 24 of pregnancy (Second Trimester).

Her daily nutritional targets (Week 24):
- Calories: 2,200 kcal/day
- Protein: 71g/day
- Iron: 27mg/day (currently low at 18mg)
- Calcium: 1,000mg/day
- Folic Acid: 600mcg/day
- DHA/Omega-3: 200mg/day
- Fibre: 28g/day

Her latest blood report showed: Hemoglobin 11.5 g/dL (slightly low), Serum Iron 72 µg/dL (slightly low), Ferritin 14 ng/mL (below optimal).

Analyze the meal described and respond ONLY in this exact JSON format (no markdown, no extra text):
{
  "food_name": "short display name",
  "calories": 000,
  "protein_g": 00,
  "iron_mg": 0.0,
  "calcium_mg": 000,
  "folate_mcg": 000,
  "fibre_g": 0.0,
  "dha_mg": 0,
  "status": "adequate" or "needs_more",
  "status_reason": "one sentence why",
